        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_21",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "loyals",
            kill: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "loyals",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:recall_unit",
                id: "$this_item.id",
                unit: "$this_item.id",
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_22",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:capture_village",
            side: 4,
            cells: "",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_23",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_24",
        on: "enemies_defeated",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_25",
        on: "turn",
        once: false,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_side",
            equals: 7,
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "variable",
                name: "turn_number",
                greater_than: 1,
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_26",
        on: "time_over",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("The orcs are not defeated, and our troops and supplies are exhausted. This is the end!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_27",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("The orcs have pushed us back to the Ka’lian. There is no way out. We must win here!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("This is our final stand. If they take the Ka’lian, all is lost!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Galtrid, speak not of defeat. Elvenkind shall rise! Our enemies shall perish in blood and fire!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("It is a dark day indeed when elves must steel themselves with dreams of slaughter."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("We’ll crush those weak elves and I’ll get da stone!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("These are hardened orc and troll veterans. Men, prepare for a long, difficult fight..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_28",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 7,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Those dwarves must still be protecting our gold — on their land."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Yes, it seems we must defend the Kalian alone."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_29",
        on: "olurf",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Did ye think we’d let you have all the fun wi’ the orcs by yerselves?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("You did, we’ve already driven them from the forest. You barely caught up in time to chase them into the hills."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Diplomacy, Landar. We do need to pursue the orcs into the mountains, and an army of dwarves will be welcome companions."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("It’s not much of an army he is bringing with him, though."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Not much of an army? These are dwarves with mighty axes, each worth three of you and your silly plinking bows!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Olurf, is that all the dwarves you could find? Was the gold not enough?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("They are no’ fighting for gold, they’re here for the fun. I’d ha’ brought a lot more if my men ha’ all kept quiet about helping elves! But the rest o’ my clan should join us in a few days."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("In a few days? That’s too late! We want our gold back!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Sure, minus expenses."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("What expenses?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("It’s an ancient dwarvish custom to buy the warriors a few drinks before the battle... So minus expenses that’s about even."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("That explains why they are so reckless in battle..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_30",
        on: "scenario_end",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "olurf_entry.x",
            value: 40,
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "olurf_entry.y",
            value: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "olurf",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_31",
        on: "scenario_end",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("At last! The orcs are defeated."),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Pirorr",
            type: "Orcish Warrior",
            side: 7,
            x: 0,
            y: 42,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Pirorr",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Pirorr",
            x: 0,
            y: 40,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("The elves have beaten us and they did not use da stone. Maybe they don’t have it? Great Chief will not like bad news!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Pirorr",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Kalenz, we are again in your debt. You returned just in time."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("And we have what’s left of the elvish treasury with us!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Perhaps the gold will give our words more weight with the Council."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Kalenz_ has returned any remaining gold into the elvish treasury. You will start the next scenario with a preset amount."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Landar_ has returned any remaining gold into the elvish treasury. You will start the next scenario with a preset amount."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_32",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Truugl%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Aargh! I should have stayed in the mountains instead of joining the orcs!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_33",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
